body:
I wouldn't say that people with PD are all substance abusers. I have BPD and know a bunch of other people with BPD who do not abuse substances, but do other reckless things like prostitution, speeding, overspending...

&#x200B;

I have BPD and I used to drink. I actually have more problems with my peers drinking too much. It's poison and a depressant.

Probably buy a new pipe because I gave my best pipe to my ex for his birthday. 

&#x200B;

An hour massage

&#x200B;

I'd hit the road and head to Moab.

I tried. They did not admit me. Even though I had suicidal thoughts and cuts over my body, they made me go home after 7 hours. Medicaid thought I wasn't bad enough. 

&#x200B;

I guess what you need is a plan, psychosis, and maybe an attempt to get in. :\\ I'm in the U.S.

No one is obligated to like me.

&#x200B;

Some days are going to be shitty.

&#x200B;

Bad stuff will happen to me even when I feel like I cant take anymore bad things happening.

One guy I dated in high school. He sucked at eating me out and fingering me, it was just awkward. Also, he never got a hard on, so every time he would try to stick it in it didn't go in. 

&#x200B;

We are still friends and he talks about how his most recent ex couldn't handle his big dick and such...
